---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /team.html
seoTitle: "Voice Over Artists, Voice Talent Toronto | Overnight Radio Inc."
seoDescription: "Overnight's Staff consists of some of the most professional producers & announcers in the industry today. Bringing you the right voice for your radio ad."
eyebrow: Team
heading: "Meet the <strong>Team</strong>"
---
{% include "page-head.njk" %}

<section class="section section--paper section--flush-top">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="intro">Overnight's Staff consists of some of the most professional radio producers, male and female voice over artists working in the industry today. All of our voice over talent have major market experience and bring that "big sound" with them. Over the years, Overnight Radio has constantly been looking for the right voices to represent us and you in the best possible way, and we are proud to say that each one of our voice over talents does just that. Click on the name of a team member below to find out more about them, and to hear their commercial voice over sample.</p>

    <h2 class="h2 h2--rule">The Production Team</h2>
    <div class="producers">
      {% for m in collections.production %}
      <article class="producer">
        <a class="producer__photo" href="{{ m.url }}"><img src="{{ (m.data.cardPhoto or m.data.photo) | asset }}" alt="{{ m.data.name }}" loading="lazy"></a>
        <div class="producer__body">
          <p class="tag">{{ m.data.role }}</p>
          <h3><a href="{{ m.url }}">{{ m.data.cardName or m.data.name }}</a></h3>
          <p>{{ m.data.summary }}</p>
          <a class="textlink" href="{{ m.url }}">Bio &amp; {{ m.data.sampleLabel | lower }} <svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-arrow-right"/></svg></a>
        </div>
      </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>

    <div class="talent-head">
      <h2 class="h2 h2--rule">Talent</h2>
      <label class="search">
        <svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-search"/></svg>
        <span class="sr-only">Find a voice</span>
        <input type="search" placeholder="Find a voice" data-team-search autocomplete="off">
      </label>
    </div>
    <ul class="talent" data-talent>
      {% for m in collections.talent %}
      <li class="voice" data-name="{{ (m.data.cardName or m.data.name) | lower }}">
        <a class="voice__link" href="{{ m.url }}">
          <span class="voice__photo"><img src="{{ (m.data.cardPhoto or m.data.photo) | asset }}" alt="" loading="lazy"></span>
          <span class="voice__name">{{ m.data.cardName or m.data.name }}</span>
          {% if m.data.roster == "non-roster" %}<span class="voice__flag">Non-roster</span>{% endif %}
        </a>
        <button class="voice__play" type="button" data-quickplay="{{ m.data.sampleMp3 | asset }}" aria-label="Play {{ m.data.cardName or m.data.name }}’s sample">
          <svg class="i-play" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-play"/></svg><svg class="i-pause" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-pause"/></svg>
        </button>
      </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
    <p class="empty" data-team-empty hidden>No voices match that name.</p>
  </div>
</section>
